  <RimPrison.SecurityLevelDef>
    <defName>RP_Supermax</defName>
    <wingOnly>true</wingOnly>
    <cellMeals>true</cellMeals>
    <escortOnly>true</escortOnly>
    <yardAlone>true</yardAlone>
    <labelShort>supermax</labelShort>
    <label>supermax security</label>
    <description>Where the worst go: staff killers, convicted murderers, hostage-takers. Locked in a single cell (a room with one bed) all day, meals brought to the cell, and never out of it without a guard: a walk to a shower with no one else in it, and an hour alone in a yard of their own, in the hours the regime sets aside for them (several, so that a unit of a few cells has them all; each patch of the yard takes one inmate at a time). A guard brings back anyone who is out of the cell with nobody. Housed only in supermax wing cells. No parole from here. Well paid when the rules sent them (a staff killer, a conviction, a hostage ringleader), at the maximum rate when it was your order, and a long stay wears people down. Not sent by the state: you move inmates here, and the court and the hostage crisis do. After ten clean days you are asked whether to step them down to maximum.</description>
    <color>(0.6, 0.25, 0.75)</color>
    <intakeGrant>0</intakeGrant>
    <dailyPayment>500</dailyPayment>
    <defaultIntakePerDay>0</defaultIntakePerDay>
    <dangerFactor>3.0</dangerFactor>
    <uiOrder>32</uiOrder>
    <defaultRegime>
